{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b67ecc9141b77deae98a61096bedc36acc3fead1505928518faffd81136204e", "ja": "（今日は響のイメージショットの撮影。響だけじゃ\nなくて、響の動物たちも一緒にロケに来ている）", "zh": "（今天拍摄的是响的印象照。不只是响，响的动物们也一起来到了外景拍摄现场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "596fd52e22a9aa15c0be5a2e72bf6f6543207d037336b1860ead8d3a22ca72c0", "ja": "{$P$}、見て！　雪！　雪だぞっ！\n冷たくて気持ちいいし、キレイさ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}，快看！是雪！是雪啊！\n又冰又舒服，还很漂亮～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f975ff764a171228792cf44836449d7fce5de67d994cf8c33297bfc447140b3d", "ja": "ああ。凄く綺麗だ。ちょっと寒いけど……。\n響は元気だなぁ。", "zh": "啊，好漂亮。虽然有点冷……  \n响真有精神啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "08e801e9888c627383828913594985a841de38cd89fcd80f6697c5c0e6b5cdce", "ja": "あはは！　これくらいへっちゃらだぞ！\nハム蔵やいぬ美たちも、いつもより元気なくらいさ～。", "zh": "啊哈哈！这点程度根本难不倒我！\n小哈和犬美它们也比平时还要精神呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "f7a082e927ee3f2e0375ebdcc12c75a7419b8f4ef2d545ecab1f9647f426808a", "ja": "おーい、みんな～！　これから撮影なんだから、\nおとなしくしなきゃダメだぞ～！", "zh": "喂——大家～！接下来要拍摄了，所以得乖乖的，不许闹哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1005_null", "source_sha256": "2982393126176bb273a4a9a662cb96be620b2b99fefa9031c039c2b14db3930f", "ja": "ヂュッワン！　シャーッヒヒーン！\nニャーガオブー、バサバサーッ！", "zh": "啾汪！嘶——咴儿咴儿！\n喵——嗷呜——，扑棱扑棱——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8304061a0166f862ec8f2ea59218b1ffa9476b0a79d2e3002ff0ceeebd0467c2", "ja": "みんな、かなりはしゃいでるみたいだな……。\n響のうちだと、かなり大人しかったのに。", "zh": "大家好像都玩得很欢啊……\n在响家里的时候明明还挺老实的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "318897a7ec31bf6e962e9f088c80e394fcd9b9dd04d62125a6a2e728ede34fd2", "ja": "あ、うん。お客さんがきたときは、\nおとなしくしてって、言ってあるからね！", "zh": "啊，嗯。因为我跟它们说过，客人来的时候要乖乖的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "d8398b39ba830adc9ac747b990a602942b324a4ecf7c7c111082ee4a3e059d0b", "ja": "今日のハム蔵たちも、ここにつくまでは\nすっごく、おとなしかったでしょ？", "zh": "今天的哈姆藏它们在到这里之前，也一直都特别安静吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a1567f4a3b74374e94769f55b0263510226f3638f42ffb89b69a0eb5cbcad214", "ja": "確かに……響の言うことがわかるんだな。\n本当にいい子達だよな。", "zh": "确实……原来我能理解响说的话。\n真的都是好孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "8ab1ed8bed1eb59b0326146e08e77edc05c5f3dac59cb3b9b215f9ad8c4b5566", "ja": "うんうん。{$P$}もそう思う？\nみんな自分の、自慢の家族さ～！", "zh": "嗯嗯。{$P$}也这么觉得吗？\n大家都是我引以为傲的家人啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5c914dc3955a32840f9f1c72b1267fadb52c11a41af7f07a2389a1c478f31779", "ja": "まあせっかくだし、もうちょっと遊んでて\nいいんじゃないか？　撮影までちょっと時間もあるし。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，再多玩一会儿也没关系吧？　离拍摄还有点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "93b574b5d5d48ee86301ddd406d23be3fde0d153ad48f4688530c6bf7baa45d9", "ja": "えっ？　ホントに！　……自分も\n実はもうちょっと、遊びたかったり……。", "zh": "咦？真的可以吗！……其实我也想再玩一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "4380cfbf98dad5d529616399615e067685585ec0cdacebb4ba6dd0452bcc28a7", "ja": "雪合戦とか……あとスキーにスノボもやりたい！\nねえ、少し滑ってきちゃダメかな。", "zh": "像打雪仗……还有滑雪和单板滑雪！\n呐，我能不能去滑一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e07366f7e08fdc94e19a559860ef433413b87d565eada3967d9765d0f14eb765", "ja": "スノボできるのか、響？　……いや。\nひとまず、その衣装のまま滑るのは、ナシだぞ。", "zh": "你会滑单板滑雪吗，响？……不对。\n总之，穿着那身服装去滑雪可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebc871b96ff14c6795d2276c7673df608404ad7d5ed52fe496c4f6b5f2569bbd", "ja": "う～。そっかぁ……そうだよね。\nでもやっぱり雪遊びはしたいぞ……うぐぐ。", "zh": "呜～。这样啊……也是呢。\n不过果然还是想玩雪啊……唔呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "1d263f133ebd66c9f83069d8dd189a6fec83acb9d80021ace790d29c855182f9", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　ソリ！　今日の撮影は、\n大きなソリに乗るんだよね？　練習していい！？", "zh": "啊，对了！雪橇！今天的拍摄是要坐大雪橇对吧？我可以练习吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a3fb3df0c1ae3a3ca154df9bdb67935bf4f635a559c86311b6a260133b42b8c1", "ja": "撮影の練習……それなら、構わないかな。\nあまり遠くには行かないでくれよ？", "zh": "练习拍摄……那样的话，应该没问题吧。\n不过可别滑得太远了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "cd30760e4eea1be1df60c448a0c7c4053e0b79b7455a9b69481897a42272a449", "ja": "やったーっ！！　よーし、みんな集まれー！\n全員でてっぺんから、ふもとまで大滑降だー！！", "zh": "太棒啦！！好——大家集合！  \n全员从山顶一路滑到山脚，来一场大滑降——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1019_p", "source_sha256": "76987c4b0eac4776a6fe7e056c82ff8220b3e08d7fba36c71ce2cf9559430ca0", "ja": "って、聞いてるか、響ーっ！\n絶対に安全運転だからなーっ！！", "zh": "喂，你听到了吗，响——！\n绝对要安全驾驶啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "919ea0c5fd7b1443153a1e34cc42606a01a7448d88ab443ecb8d5200f6a2a54b", "ja": "大丈夫だって、{$P$}！\n自分、わかってるってばっ！", "zh": "没事的啦，{$P$}！\n我都说了心里有数啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0194_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "cef8fe4244e50f625b2faae73703575a3c6d97a5f5227f4d11e2bc0d5a969f86", "ja": "さあ、坂の上まで一気に押すんだぞ！\n着いたらみんな乗り込んで、出発さーっ♪", "zh": "来，一口气推到坡顶！到了以后大家都上来，出发啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
